  m_text: 'Once upon a time, in the magical land of Equestria...

    Royal Sisters
    deliver gifts to homes to lift the spirits of the ponies who power the Warming
    Heart. Periodically, Windigo breach the thermodome and steal the Heart. Royal
    Sisters must intercept and retrieve it before it is snatched away.'
